{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YaFY4jH9DcGqrMC5aUKJrh","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: «WORKING_AREA»/issues/01-theme-end-to-end-system-mode.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb","uuid":"a8d8e624-301e-401d-94e7-bd889117b4e4","timestamp":"2026-09-24T02:41:18.443Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"«WORKING_AREA»/issues/01-theme-end-to-end-system-mode.md","content":"# 01: Theme end-to-end: System mode with profile field\n\n**Blocked by:** None\n**Status:** ready-for-agent\n\nAdd a `themePreference` profile field (default \"system\"), a theme control on the Settings page, and live OS tracking applied before first paint.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A user with no saved preference sees the theme that matches their OS, with no flash on load, and it updates live when the OS setting changes.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfMVWsA1rkZoHuGRUBWMs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VdsP28YtCF2mG1WeXmA3WD","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"«WORKING_AREA»/issues/02-theme-toggle-control.md","content":"# 02: Theme toggle control\n\n**Blocked by:** 01\n**Status:** ready-for-agent\n\nAdd Light/Dark overrides that save to the profile and apply instantly, sync across devices, revert on save errors, and meet WCAG AA contrast.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Choosing Light or Dark applies immediately, persists across logout/login and devices, and reverts with an error message if the save fails.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":356,"cache_read_input_tokens":18750,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":356},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb","uuid":"3ae21c57-0535-4ac2-9170-96362f5b19fb","timestamp":"2026-09-24T02:41:20.768Z","request_id":"req_011CfMVWrjiU4LS9qfu4cDea","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01VdsP28YtCF2mG1WeXmA3WD":{"file_path":"«WORKING_AREA»/issues/02-theme-toggle-control.md","content":"# 02: Theme toggle control\n\n**Blocked by:** 01\n**Status:** ready-for-agent\n\nAdd Light/Dark overrides that save to the profile and apply instantly, sync across devices, revert on save errors, and meet WCAG AA contrast.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Choosing Light or Dark applies immediately, persists across logout/login and devices, and reverts with an error message if the save fails.\n"}}}
